{"ref":"BDB, טֶ֫לֶם","hw":"טֶ֫לֶם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">טֶ֫לֶם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> et <strong>pers. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.loc.</strong> in the Negeb of Judah, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:24\" href=\"/Joshua.15.24\">Jos 15:24</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">טלאים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.4\">1 S 15:4</a>, read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">טֵלָאם</span> We Dr. We reads <span dir=\"rtl\">טֵלָם</span> also for <span dir=\"rtl\">חוילה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.7\">1 S 15:7</a>, cf. Dr.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.m.</strong> one of the porters <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:24\" href=\"/Ezra.10.24\">Ezr 10:24</a>.","next":"BDB, טַלְמֹן","prev":"BDB, טלם"}